1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:02,440
The sun is going down.

2
00:00:02,440 --> 00:00:05,000
It's almost bedtime for Mimzi.

3
00:00:05,550 --> 00:00:08,775
Teddy, is it bedtime already?

4
00:00:09,325 --> 00:00:12,050
Yes! Let's get ready!

5
00:00:13,750 --> 00:00:16,000
First, Mimzi puts her toys away.

6
00:00:17,550 --> 00:00:19,899
Good night, toys!

7
00:00:21,599 --> 00:00:25,074
Next, she puts on her cozy pajamas.

8
00:00:25,624 --> 00:00:28,873
My pajamas have little stars!

9
00:00:30,573 --> 00:00:33,098
Then she brushes her teeth.

10
00:00:33,348 --> 00:00:35,748
Brush, brush, brush!

11
00:00:39,548 --> 00:00:41,273
Now it's story time.

12
00:00:41,273 --> 00:00:43,748
Mimzi picks her favorite book.

13
00:00:44,298 --> 00:00:46,998
Read it again, please!

14
00:00:48,698 --> 00:00:51,698
A big hug and a kiss good night.

15
00:00:52,248 --> 00:00:54,748
I love you, Teddy.

16
00:00:55,298 --> 00:00:58,198
I love you too, Mimzi.

17
00:00:59,898 --> 00:01:00,967
Lights off.

18
00:01:00,967 --> 00:01:02,723
The moon is shining.

19
00:01:02,973 --> 00:01:05,398
The stars are twinkling.

20
00:01:05,948 --> 00:01:07,643
Good night, moon.

21
00:01:07,643 --> 00:01:09,423
Good night, stars.

22
00:01:11,373 --> 00:01:13,230
Did you like the story?

23
00:01:13,230 --> 00:01:15,372
Let's remember it together!

24
00:01:15,922 --> 00:01:17,570
Do you remember?

25
00:01:17,570 --> 00:01:18,697
Let's see!

26
00:01:20,397 --> 00:01:22,472
What happened here?

27
00:01:24,672 --> 00:01:26,697
Toys away!

28
00:01:27,247 --> 00:01:29,647
Yes! Well done!

29
00:01:31,347 --> 00:01:33,422
What happened here?

30
00:01:35,622 --> 00:01:37,572
Pajamas!

31
00:01:38,122 --> 00:01:40,122
That's right!

32
00:01:41,822 --> 00:01:43,897
What happened here?

33
00:01:46,097 --> 00:01:47,846
Toothbrush!

34
00:01:48,396 --> 00:01:50,496
Great job!

35
00:01:52,196 --> 00:01:54,271
What happened here?

36
00:01:56,471 --> 00:01:58,521
Story time!

37
00:01:59,071 --> 00:02:01,121
You got it!

38
00:02:02,821 --> 00:02:04,896
What happened here?

39
00:02:07,096 --> 00:02:08,672
Hugs!

40
00:02:09,222 --> 00:02:10,997
Super!

41
00:02:12,697 --> 00:02:14,772
What happened here?

42
00:02:16,972 --> 00:02:18,771
Lights off!

43
00:02:19,321 --> 00:02:21,071
Hooray!

44
00:02:22,771 --> 00:02:25,321
What do we put on at bedtime?

45
00:02:27,521 --> 00:02:30,170
Our cozy pajamas!

46
00:02:30,720 --> 00:02:32,720
That's right!

47
00:02:34,420 --> 00:02:37,544
Wow! You remembered everything!

48
00:02:39,394 --> 00:02:42,144
You are a super learner!

49
00:02:43,844 --> 00:02:49,044
Toys away, pajamas on, brush teeth, story, hugs, and sleep.

50
00:02:49,594 --> 00:02:51,609
Share Mimzi with a friend,

51
00:02:51,609 --> 00:02:54,319
and subscribe for more learning fun!

52
00:02:54,919 --> 00:02:56,698
Good night, friends.

53
00:02:56,698 --> 00:02:58,245
See you tomorrow!
